    "amount": "• Scholarship covers 100% of annual fees as per the course fee structure\n• The hostel and mess fees shall be given to all eligible students.\n• A laptop will be provided to all Bharti Scholars during the first year of the course.\n\nUpon successful graduation and subsequent gainful employment, Bharti Scholars will undertake to voluntarily support at least one student at the school or college level on a continuous basis.",
