    "amount": "• An amount of Rs.20,000/- per annum will be awarded to the selected Regular Scholar and shall be payable in three instalments.\n• An amount of Rs.10,000/ per annum will be awarded for selected Special Girl Child and scholarship shall be payable in three instalments.",
