    "amount": "Doctoral Scholarship\nJRF (First 2 years)\nStipend - ₹ 37,000 per month\nContingency Grant - ₹ 40,000 per year\nSRF (thereafter)\nStipend - ₹ 42,000 per month\nContingency Grant - ₹ 40,000 per year\nHRA as per GoI norms\n\nMaster's Scholarship\nStipend - ₹ 8,000 per month",
